{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpectedly, you click on a link to a \u201cThe Game That Dies When You Play It\u201d you was posted on a certain bulletin board. When you start up the game, you encounter a warning of \u201cEscape\u201d and a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to avoid death...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Flow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the\u00a0desktop horror adventure game.\u00a0The virtual desktop contains a game, a browser, and several applications. You will seek ways to avoid death by using not only the game but also various information displayed on your desktop and browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is FPS perspective. You will use items such as knives and lighters to clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846720/extras/06bd7503dee8f43f752c21aad4912b8b.avif?t=1753825269\" width=1002 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three endings: Bad, Normal, and True.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846720?t=1753825269","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846720?t=1753825269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846720/e43caa0f720c4b4bf9589597ec36af512b7cea35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753825269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846720/e43caa0f720c4b4bf9589597ec36af512b7cea35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753825269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpectedly, you click on a link to a \u201cThe Game That Dies When You Play It\u201d you was posted on a certain bulletin board. When you start up the game, you encounter a warning of \u201cEscape\u201d and a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to avoid death...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Flow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the\u00a0desktop horror adventure game.\u00a0The virtual desktop contains a game, a browser, and several applications. You will seek ways to avoid death by using not only the game but also various information displayed on your desktop and browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is FPS perspective. You will use items such as knives and lighters to clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846720/extras/06bd7503dee8f43f752c21aad4912b8b.avif?t=1753825269\" width=1002 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three endings: Bad, Normal, and True.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hartree FR"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846720/2320690bad799a036247c625664d62d8d6e1eda8/header.jpg?t=1753825269","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846720/1416722585/8f0705964413d508d8ae51c0238b5dc090efa302/1751632548/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753825266","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846720/1416722585/8f0705964413d508d8ae51c0238b5dc090efa302/1751632548/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753825266","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846720/1416722585/8f0705964413d508d